<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<%- include('../partials/nav') %>
<main class="container">
  <%- include('_admin_nav') %>
  <%- include('../partials/alerts') %>

  <section class="card" style="margin-bottom:18px">
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <div>
        <h1 style="margin-bottom:6px">API • Servidor DayZ</h1>
        <p class="muted" style="max-width:850px">FTP/SFTP foi removido. O mod consulta esta API por HTTP em um único lote por ciclo e mantém journal/cache local para evitar entrega duplicada.</p>
      </div>
      <span style="padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;background:<%= apiStatus.connected ? 'rgba(34,197,94,.15)' : 'rgba(239,68,68,.15)' %>;color:<%= apiStatus.connected ? '#86efac' : '#fca5a5' %>">
        <%= apiStatus.connected ? '● API CONECTADA' : '● MOD DESCONECTADO' %>
      </span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card" style="margin-bottom:18px">
    <h2>Status da integração</h2>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:14px">
      <div class="notice"><small>API_KEY no site</small><br><strong><%= apiKeyConfigured ? 'CONFIGURADA' : 'AUSENTE' %></strong></div>
      <div class="notice"><small>Último contato do mod</small><br><strong><%= apiStatus.ageSeconds === null ? 'NUNCA' : `${apiStatus.ageSeconds}s atrás` %></strong></div>
      <div class="notice"><small>Players online informados</small><br><strong><%= apiStatus.heartbeat?.onlinePlayers ?? 0 %></strong></div>
      <div class="notice"><small>Entregas PENDING</small><br><strong><%= pendingDeliveries %></strong></div>
      <div class="notice"><small>Servidor</small><br><strong><%= apiStatus.heartbeat?.serverId || '-' %></strong></div>
      <div class="notice"><small>Versão do mod</small><br><strong><%= apiStatus.heartbeat?.modVersion || '-' %></strong></div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top:16px">
      <small class="muted">Endpoint usado pelo mod</small>
      <div style="margin-top:6px;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);word-break:break-all"><code><%= apiStatus.endpoint %></code></div>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:16px">
      <form method="POST" action="/admin/ftp/test"><button class="btn primary" type="submit">🔌 TESTAR CONEXÃO DO MOD</button></form>
      <form method="POST" action="/admin/ftp/sync"><button class="btn" type="submit">📦 VER FILA PENDENTE</button></form>
      <button class="btn" type="button" onclick="location.reload()">↻ ATUALIZAR STATUS</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h2>Configuração necessária</h2>
    <p class="muted">Use a <strong>mesma API_KEY</strong> nos dois lados. No Railway, configure a variável <code>API_KEY</code>. No servidor DayZ, abra <code>$profile:SobreviventesZ_Store/SZ_StoreConfig.json</code> e preencha <code>ApiBaseUrl</code> e <code>ApiKey</code>.</p>
    <pre style="white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:auto;margin-top:12px;padding:14px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.25)">{
  "ApiEnabled": true,
  "ApiBaseUrl": "<%= String(apiStatus.endpoint || '').replace('/api/game/bridge/poll','') %>",
  "ApiKey": "MESMA_CHAVE_DO_RAILWAY",
  "ApiServerId": "zonaz-vanilla-1",
  "ApiPollEverySeconds": 5,
  "ApiFullVipSyncEverySeconds": 300
}</pre>
    <p class="muted" style="margin-top:12px">A chave nunca é exibida neste painel. Quando o mod fizer o primeiro poll válido, o status acima muda automaticamente para <strong>API CONECTADA</strong>.</p>
  </section>
</main>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
